pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$white"
notes: "本页展示标准四步排障操作流。很多用户在遇到断网时，往往没有条理，一会儿重启手机，一会儿拔电源，甚至拿牙签去戳Reset孔。我们设计的‘查灯-查线-查端-序贯重启’流程，是一个严格递进的排除法闭环。每一步都有清晰的检查动作与分支判据。只有在前一步排除了外部物理故障后，才进入下一步的终端与重启操作。这样既能保证在5分钟内定位故障，又能彻底避免误操作带来的配置损失。"
elements:
  - elementId: top-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 20, 880, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: nav-section
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 28, 260, 18]
    content:
      text: "阶段三 / 流程示范 (DEMONSTRATION)"
      fontSize: 9.5
      bold: true
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      letterSpacing: 1.0

  - elementId: running-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 28, 240, 18]
    content:
      text: "家庭网络排障实操课 · 标准处置流"
      fontSize: 9.5
      color: "$grayLight"
      align: [right, top]

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 48, 880, 28]
    content:
      text: "遵循「一查灯、二查线、三查配、四重启」标准排障操作流"
      style: "$title"

  - elementId: page-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 78, 880, 20]
    content:
      text: "严格按因果梯度推进排查，杜绝未定界前的无序盲动与意外二次致障"
      style: "$subtitle"

  - elementId: step-1-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 110, 195, 290]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$bgLight" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: step-1-badge
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [54, 122, 60, 22]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primaryDeep" }

  - elementId: step-1-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 122, 60, 22]
    content:
      text: "步骤 01"
      style: "$badge"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false

  - elementId: step-1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [190, 122, 22, 22]
    iconName: "fas:lightbulb"
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primaryDeep" }

  - elementId: step-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 150, 168, 22]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>一查灯态 (定界)</strong></p>"
      fontSize: 12.5
      color: "$primaryDeep"

  - elementId: step-1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 174, 168, 116]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong>标准操作：</strong><br/>先低头看光猫 LOS/PON，再看路由器 WAN 口指示灯。</p>
        <p><strong>判定基准：</strong><br/>• LOS 红灯闪 ➔ 局端断光，立即报修；<br/>• WAN 橙灯 ➔ 物理网线松脱，进入第 2 步；<br/>• 全绿 ➔ 进入第 3 步。</p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.6
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: step-1-criteria-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 300, 175, 88]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$white" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 0.75, color: "$grayBorder" }

  - elementId: step-1-criteria-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 306, 163, 76]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>准出标准：</strong><br/>在 10 秒内确认是「外部光纤断裂」还是「内部设备/线缆问题」，避免盲目处理。</p>"
      fontSize: 9.2
      color: "$grayText"
      lineHeight: 1.3

  - elementId: arrow-step-1-2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [238, 230, 28, 20]
    viewBox: [28, 20]
    points: "0,10 26,10"
    border: { style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary" }
    arrow: [null, triangle]

  - elementId: step-2-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [268, 110, 195, 290]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$bgLight" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: step-2-badge
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [282, 122, 60, 22]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: step-2-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [282, 122, 60, 22]
    content:
      text: "步骤 02"
      style: "$badge"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false

  - elementId: step-2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [418, 122, 22, 22]
    iconName: "fas:plug"
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: step-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [282, 150, 168, 22]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>二查网线 (物理)</strong></p>"
      fontSize: 12.5
      color: "$primaryDeep"

  - elementId: step-2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [282, 174, 168, 116]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong>标准操作：</strong><br/>拔下光猫 LAN 到路由 WAN 口网线，重新按紧直至清脆卡扣声。</p>
        <p><strong>判定基准：</strong><br/>• 必须确认插在 WAN 口而非 LAN 口；<br/>• 观察 WAN 口小灯是否恢复闪烁；<br/>• 若仍不亮换备用网线测试。</p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.6
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: step-2-criteria-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [278, 300, 175, 88]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$white" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 0.75, color: "$grayBorder" }

  - elementId: step-2-criteria-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [284, 306, 163, 76]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>准出标准：</strong><br/>确认物理层 8 根铜线触点接触优良，排除 46% 常见的网线松脱致障隐患。</p>"
      fontSize: 9.2
      color: "$grayText"
      lineHeight: 1.3

  - elementId: arrow-step-2-3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [466, 230, 28, 20]
    viewBox: [28, 20]
    points: "0,10 26,10"
    border: { style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary" }
    arrow: [null, triangle]

  - elementId: step-3-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [496, 110, 195, 290]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$bgLight" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: step-3-badge
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [510, 122, 60, 22]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$cyan" }

  - elementId: step-3-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [510, 122, 60, 22]
    content:
      text: "步骤 03"
      style: "$badge"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false

  - elementId: step-3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [646, 122, 22, 22]
    iconName: "fas:mobile-screen"
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$cyan" }

  - elementId: step-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [510, 150, 168, 22]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>三查终端 (交叉)</strong></p>"
      fontSize: 12.5
      color: "$primaryDeep"

  - elementId: step-3-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [510, 174, 168, 116]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong>标准操作：</strong><br/>使用第二台手机或电脑连接同个 Wi-Fi 访问网页。</p>
        <p><strong>判定基准：</strong><br/>• 若仅单台打不开 ➔ 终端私密 MAC 异常或 DNS 错误，忽略网络重连；<br/>• 若所有终端均断网 ➔ 确认局域网或路由死锁，进第 4 步。</p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.6
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: step-3-criteria-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [506, 300, 175, 88]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$white" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 0.75, color: "$grayBorder" }

  - elementId: step-3-criteria-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [512, 306, 163, 76]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>准出标准：</strong><br/>通过横向设备交叉验证，准确分离「单机软件层故障」与「网络基础设施故障」。</p>"
      fontSize: 9.2
      color: "$grayText"
      lineHeight: 1.3

  - elementId: arrow-step-3-4
    elementType: line
    bounds: [694, 230, 28, 20]
    viewBox: [28, 20]
    points: "0,10 26,10"
    border: { style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary" }
    arrow: [null, triangle]

  - elementId: step-4-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [724, 110, 196, 290]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$bgLight" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: step-4-badge
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [738, 122, 60, 22]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primaryDeep" }

  - elementId: step-4-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [738, 122, 60, 22]
    content:
      text: "步骤 04"
      style: "$badge"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false

  - elementId: step-4-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [876, 122, 22, 22]
    iconName: "fas:rotate-right"
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primaryDeep" }

  - elementId: step-4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [738, 150, 170, 22]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>四序贯重启 (恢复)</strong></p>"
      fontSize: 12.5
      color: "$primaryDeep"

  - elementId: step-4-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [738, 174, 170, 116]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><strong>标准操作：</strong><br/>严格遵循「先拔光猫、再拔路由、等待30秒、先开光猫、后开路由」时序。</p>
        <p><strong>判定基准：</strong><br/>• 切断电源使滤波电容彻底放电；<br/>• 待光猫 PON 稳定常绿后，再插路由器电源；<br/>• 释放锁死会话与旧租约。</p>
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.6
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: step-4-criteria-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [734, 300, 176, 88]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$white" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 0.75, color: "$grayBorder" }

  - elementId: step-4-criteria-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [740, 306, 164, 76]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>准出标准：</strong><br/>设备以全新状态完成 PPPoE 拨号与 DHCP 分发，自愈 95% 以上的系统级假死。</p>"
      fontSize: 9.2
      color: "$grayText"
      lineHeight: 1.3

  - elementId: warning-banner
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 414, 880, 52]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$lightBlue" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: warning-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [54, 428, 22, 22]
    iconName: "fas:triangle-exclamation"
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$warning" }

  - elementId: warning-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [86, 424, 820, 36]
    content:
      text: "<p><strong>⚠️ 操作高压红线：排障全程严禁捅刺 Reset 复位小孔！</strong>Reset 会将路由器内部宽带账号密码清零并还原默认出厂 Wi-Fi，将一次简单的线路接触不良转变为必须依赖运维师傅上门重配的灾难性事故。</p>"
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.35

  - elementId: bottom-source-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 508, 800, 18]
    content:
      text: "作业指引：宽带网络服务工程师标准化现场排障操作规范 (SOP 2024 版)"
      style: "$caption"

  - elementId: bottom-page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [870, 508, 50, 18]
    content:
      text: "05"
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, top]
